fore probing with `sandbox-exec: ... test/results/geometry-nl0-v1/stage/case/library/M001-0001/work/sandbox.sb: No such file or directory` (and likewise for M002). Thus no checked M-source evidence or full probed signatures/axiom reports can be registered. I cannot fabricate the required evidence or submit an NL0 falsely claiming source completion. This is an operational source-evidence block, not a finding that the exercise is false or that the proof route has a substantive mathematical gap.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"Task inputs frozen-target.md, problem.md, proof-draft.json, and source-context.md were read. The relevant NL0 v2 Yui rules for stage, format, self-containment, authoring, logical packaging, external/M source requirements, and templates were read. The draft's intended covering route was reviewed: its lower-bound interval-enlargement idea is logically plausible because each original projection B_i is contained in its enclosing interval J_i, so the enlarged-index family still covers every fiber; zero-diameter and scale-content details require explicit completion. No complete NL0 graph or Audit A review was created, and no acceptance is claimed. Source evidence must be obtained through successful pinned probes (or the source facts must be proved internally) before an artifact can responsibly be submitted.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Frozen target: for every n≥0 and nonempty compact E⊆Euclidean R^n, with I=[0,1] and the concatenated Euclidean metric on E×I, prove dim_H(E×I)=dim_H(E)+1; no extra hypotheses or definition properties were added. Candidate route retained: Hausdorff-cover subdivision for the upper bound; fiber covers, interval enlargements, and integration of the covering-cost inequality for the positive-dimension lower bound; nonempty-set coordinate projection for the zero-dimension lower bound. The pinned source file was located and read at Mathlib/Topology/MetricSpace/HausdorffDimension.lean, including the printed threshold-characterization declarations, but required probe evidence is unavailable. No structured spec/graph has been submitted, since a source-complete graph and evidence are not available.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after i